 **Design:** [system-design.md#contracts](system-design.md#contracts)
 
+### Specialty directory
+
+<a id="req-specialtydirectory-001"></a>
+
+Staff also ask the inverse question: which veterinarians hold a given specialty. A specialty directory answers it, listing every specialty the clinic knows under its stored name, each with the veterinarians holding it `[REQ-SPECIALTYDIRECTORY-001]`. Every veterinarian is named in full, first name then last name. The page lists specialties rather than the roster, so a veterinarian holding no specialty appears nowhere on it. Every specialty appears on the one page, with no paging. The directory has its own address and is reachable by it alone; no page leads to it.
+
+**Done when:**
+- `[REQ-SPECIALTYDIRECTORY-001]` given the clinic's specialties, when the directory is opened, then every one of them is listed under its stored name on a single page.
+- `[REQ-SPECIALTYDIRECTORY-001]` given a specialty held by one or more veterinarians, when the directory is opened, then each of those veterinarians is named by first name then last name.
+- `[REQ-SPECIALTYDIRECTORY-001]` given a veterinarian holding no specialty, when the directory is opened, then that veterinarian does not appear anywhere on it.
+- `[REQ-SPECIALTYDIRECTORY-001]` given a specialty held by no veterinarian, when the directory is opened, then it is listed as held by none.
+- `[REQ-SPECIALTYDIRECTORY-001]` given the directory's address, when it is requested directly, then the page is shown.
+- `[REQ-SPECIALTYDIRECTORY-001]` given any page of the system, when it is rendered, then it carries no navigation entry and no link leading to the directory.
+- `[REQ-SPECIALTYDIRECTORY-001]` given a reader who has asked for a supported language, when the directory is opened, then its wording is presented in that language.
+
+**Edge cases:**
+1. A veterinarian holding more than one specialty appears under each of them.
+2. The specialties, and the veterinarians listed under each, are presented in a stable order rather than an arbitrary one.
+
+**Design:** [system-design.md#contracts](system-design.md#contracts)
